answerSummary:
组件职责：展示会员券包中的可用/不可用券，支持单选与同组互斥提示，回传选中券 ID 列表；不可用券置灰并展示原因。Props：coupons（券列表，含 couponId/templateName/thresholdAmount/discountAmount/usable/unusableReason/stackableGroup）、selectedIds、maxSelect（默认 3）。React 骨架：

```jsx
import { useCallback } from 'react';

export default function CouponSelector({ coupons = [], selectedIds = [], maxSelect = 3, onChange }) {
  const toggle = useCallback((c) => {
    if (!c.usable) return;
    const picked = selectedIds.includes(c.couponId);
    if (picked) {
      onChange(selectedIds.filter((id) => id !== c.couponId));
      return;
    }
    // 同组互斥：先移除同一 stackableGroup 已选中的券
    const sameGroup = coupons
      .filter((x) => x.stackableGroup === c.stackableGroup)
      .map((x) => x.couponId);
    const next = selectedIds.filter((id) => !sameGroup.includes(id));
    if (next.length >= maxSelect) return;
    onChange([...next, c.couponId]);
  }, [coupons, selectedIds, maxSelect, onChange]);

  if (!coupons.length) return <p className="empty">暂无可用优惠券</p>;

  return (
    <ul className="coupon-list">
      {coupons.map((c) => (
        <li
          key={c.couponId}
          className={`coupon-item ${c.usable ? '' : 'disabled'} ${selectedIds.includes(c.couponId) ? 'selected' : ''}`}
          onClick={() => toggle(c)}
        >
          <span className="amount">¥{c.discountAmount}</span>
          <div className="info">
            <p className="name">{c.templateName}</p>
            <p className="threshold">满 {c.thresholdAmount} 元可用</p>
            {!c.usable && <p className="reason">{c.unusableReason}</p>}
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  );
}
```

边界处理：券包为空展示空态；达到 maxSelect 上限时其余券点击无响应并提示「单笔最多使用 3 张券」；运费券不计入 3 张上限，由父组件单独维护；不可用原因文案直接取接口返回，前端不自行拼装。
